"NemesisSeizesControl1" "In 1945, six members of the Freedom Phalanx met on Peregrine Island to save the world. The clever Dr. Mnemonic had synthesized an antidote to the poison gas Nemesis had released across the country, but it had to be distributed quickly. With only minutes to spare, these six heroes took off across the country carrying large batches of the airborne antidote. They managed to get the antidote to each infected city, preventing a disaster of epic proportions."
"Medicom" "<face heading><span align=center>Medicom and Defeat</span></face><br><br><span align=both>The Medicom is a state of the art analysis and healing device. It will analyze the current medical status of a friendly target and teleport them to the nearest hospital upon defeat. Equipping every Hero with a Medicom patch is the only thing keeping Paragon City from being overrun.<br><br>If you have a revive Inspiration you may use it instead of clicking OK to go to the Hospital, or you can wait for an associate to revive you..</span>"
